flowchart TD
    Start["Import an authored adventure"] --> Source{"Source"}
    Source -->|Upload or startup scan| File["Read ADV JSON or validate an ADZ archive"]
    Source -->|Community catalog| Index["Resolve the selected entry from the configured index"]
    Index --> Blueprint["Download and validate identity, format and supported behavior"]
    Blueprint --> Compatible{"Compatible?"}
    Compatible -->|No| Reject["Return a compatibility error before asset downloads"]
    Compatible -->|Yes| Assets["Download bounded files from the configured source"]
    Assets --> Bundle["Assemble the converted ADZ"]
    Bundle --> File
    File --> Validate["Check envelope, archive paths, entries and resource budgets"]
    Validate --> Transaction["Enter the existing import transaction"]
    Transaction --> Conflict["Apply ownership and replacement policy; catalog updates preserve old templates"]
    Conflict --> Persist["Create a template and construct its world from authored data"]
    Persist --> Media["Map bundled assets and prepare thumbnails"]
    Media --> Result{"Import complete?"}
    Result -->|Yes| Commit["Commit a ready template, then clean deferred replacements"]
    Result -->|No| Rollback["Roll back and clean newly created assets"]
    Commit --> Done["Available in Library; no playthrough started"]
    Rollback --> Reject
    File -.-> Separate["Saved sessions and single-entity bundles use their own import paths"]
